# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Appointment form delivery
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Set ONE of the options below. With neither set, the form runs in demo mode
# and tells visitors their request was NOT sent.

# Option A (configured route): Web3Forms -> email.
# Get a free access key at https://web3forms.com — enter the destination email
# address, confirm it from your inbox, and paste the key here. No account
# needed. Free tier covers 250 submissions/month.
#
# This key is public by design: it only permits sending to the one address
# registered against it, and cannot read past submissions.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=

# Option B: your own JSON endpoint (serverless function, custom backend).
# Receives a JSON POST — see README.md for the payload shape.
VITE_APPOINTMENT_ENDPOINT=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER put an SMTP password, Gmail app password or private API token in a
# VITE_* variable. Everything prefixed VITE_ is bundled into the JavaScript
# sent to the browser and is readable by anyone who views the page source.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
